#: wpc-ajax-search.php:689
msgid "This plugin will check the conditions from the top down the list to find if the input keyword matches any condition. When one condition is satisfied, the smart search’ checking process will stop and show the defined products as search results. The checking process won’t stop until a satisfied condition is found in the list. If no conditions are met by the input keyword(s), normal search results will be shown instead."
msgstr ""

